note: "how many Ls are there", with or without a question mark, is "how many Ls there are".
let scores be a list of 72, 95 and 88.
say how many scores are there.
how many scores are there?
say how many scores there are.
say "There are [how many scores are there] scores.".
let guests be a list of "Ana".
say how many guests is there.
if how many scores are there is 3, say "three".
